{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_st03","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-ST-3","storyName":"《狂欢节章程》","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"狂欢节当日，大帝与大祭司帮助工人们修复受损的花车。英格丽已经知晓自己追查的真凶是谁，老裁缝劝她离开。甘比诺奉小威尼斯之命控制港口调度，拉普兰德却在此时找上门来。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"next":19,"characters":["诺埃米","大帝","大祭司","大帝&大祭司","惆怅的商人","犟嘴的合伙人","？？？","阿格尼尔","翁贝托","英格丽","调度员","港口工人","甘比诺","“调度员”","拉普兰德"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$holiday_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_holiday_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fixcarjingle","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"animtext","id":11,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月9日    12:05 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":12},{"type":"animtextclean","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#2$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"“吃饱了也要争最后一块”！披萨外送！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"这里有小南瓜甜椒、奶酪、薯条香肠、什锦、魔鬼辣椒，还有最最经典的番茄奶酪口味！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"大家先来吃饭吧，肚子空空干活会没有力气的。这一份给您，大帝......抱歉，我还是叫您顾问吧。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humaneat","volume":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"唔~口感不错，饼皮松软又有嚼劲，肉香浓郁。这家店的名片有吗？给我一张。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"这是我借了港口工人们的厨房自己做的。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"唔，您要是喜欢的话，我可以把配方写给您。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"唔——","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"别不好意思，都是应该的。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"要不是您帮忙，赶在今晚巡游开始之前把所有受损的花车修复好，这种事我们根本不敢想。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"我只是在想，龙门人吃不吃得惯正宗的叙拉古披萨。改天让能天使研究一下，说不定可以加进“大地的尽头”的菜单里。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#2$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"大帝顾问，那位边工作边唱歌的老师，不过来吃一点吗？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"喂，大嘴巴，快过来，这里有东西能堵住你的嘴。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wing","volume":"1","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#1$1","posfrom":"-50,80","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"一时间不知道该吐槽你这个随时随地都要高歌一曲的臭毛病，还是你的破锣嗓子，又或者你唱的歌本身......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"这个调调是什么，你们在雨林里搭积木时的劳动号子？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#4$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"不唱我开心不起来，干活没劲。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"肥仔，你只是悠哉地坐在一边提供所谓的“造型指导”，真正挥汗如雨跑上跑下敲敲打打的可是我大祭司！","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你有卖力的理由，我没有。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"谁让你的花车在火场跟着遭了殃呢，啧，是屁股被烧掉了对吧？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#4$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"......","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wing","volume":"1","id":58},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-10","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.1","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-10","posto":"0,100","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.2","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,100","posto":"0,-20","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.1","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"0.15","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,90","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.2","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,90","posto":"0,-25","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.1","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-25","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.05","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"气死我了气死我了，做得一点都不酷炫就算了，还把我和那只狼摆得那么近！","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"警察小姑娘，其他断手断脚的花车基本修补好了，还剩下那只烧得就剩一堆渣渣的狼。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"照我说，与其要在这么短的时间内重新造一辆出来，不如我再花点功夫把其他花车改造得更拉风一点！","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"反正花车那么多，少一只狼肯定没人能看出来！","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"有道理。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"不、不行。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"虽然叙拉古关于野兽的传说有很多，但狼有特殊的意义。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"而且市政厅很早就宣传过花车的数量和原型，如果真的少了一辆，会引起不必要的恐慌的......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"multiline","name":"大祭司","text":"其实吧——","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#4$1","id":85},{"type":"multiline","name":"大祭司","text":"喂，肥仔，不要直接往我嘴里塞——","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humaneat","volume":"1","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#6$1","id":90},{"type":"multiline","name":"大祭司","end":"true","text":"唔，放了烤菠萝？有叛逆精神。","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"叙拉古的警察都要学做披萨吗？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"啊不是的。我爸爸在别的城市开了间披萨店，我从小就在里面打工。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"我们店的口碑很好哦，小时候我梦到过我们在全叙拉古开了分店，甚至有一个专门的移动地块来做总部。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#2$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"或许您听过我们的广告——“诺埃米披萨，让您吃饱了也要争最后一块！”","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝&大祭司","text":"......没有。","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"我们始终没攒够钱开第一家分店。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"虽然生意还不错，也没有客人敢逃单或者吃霸王餐，但给家族的保护费几乎就是我们全部的利润......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"所以听说新沃尔西尼警察学校招生，我就跑来了。当上警察了，说不定就可以保护店里。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"呃......","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"您是不是也想说我的想法很幼稚？其实当警察比开分店难多了，这几天也确实接二连三出了好多事情......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"换个角度想问题，年轻人。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"你当了警察，起码可以改一句更有辨识度更能刺激消费的广告词——","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"“诺埃米披萨，不好吃你把我铐起来！”","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"啊......","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"你让我想起我家祖玛玛了，年轻人总是想法很简单，也很有干劲。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#4$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"唉，都怪你这肥仔，突然把我拉到这里来，我都没来得及跟祖玛玛说一声。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"值得我们一聚的派对并不多，大嘴巴。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"更何况，派对结束之后，咱们还有正经事要谈。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#2$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"总之，还是感谢两位！要不是你们突然出现，还主动帮忙，我们真不知道该怎么办了。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"至于报酬，等到狂欢节结束，我会第一时间向市政厅申请的。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"报酬你刚刚已经付过了。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humaneat","volume":"1","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"大帝又往嘴里塞了一块披萨。","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1429_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大祭司","text":"看在披萨的分上，帮人帮到底。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_1429_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humaneat","volume":"1","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"大祭司又往嘴里塞了一块披萨。","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"不过说真的，看着这蠢狼被烧得只剩一堆渣渣，真是没来由地解气。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1552_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺埃米","text":"啊，那您......","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1552_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_105_emper","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大帝","text":"但我更讨厌派对被搞砸。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_105_emper.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_noisycitytraffic","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"n","id":147},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"唉，世事无常啊！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"我刚刚一路过来，其他摊位都在热火朝天地布置，准备晚上大赚一笔，只有我们，被提前宣判了死刑。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"我不管，这次的损失你一个人承担。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犟嘴的合伙人","text":"你这就有点耍无赖了啊，我当时也是好心啊！前天突然下了那么大一场雨，我想着能尽量减少点损失嘛。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"所以你放着晾在庭院里的食材不管，冲出去推啤酒车？","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犟嘴的合伙人","text":"忙中出错......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"啤酒车有智能恒温系统，又是封闭的，被雨淋了也没什么，结果你把它推了回来，害得我好不容易抢到的摊位被别人占了！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"现在，摊位没了，食材没了，这哪是什么狂欢节，分明是我的葬礼！","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"早知道就该继续拍电影，虽然那些家族的人动不动就来片场指手画脚，但好歹有口饭吃，非要听你这混蛋胡吹，跑来这儿——","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犟嘴的合伙人","text":"你、你又来了！","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"n","fadetime":"2","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"Zzz，Zzz......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"原来您还没走啊！怎么吃完一支冰淇淋后还原地睡着了？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"神父，神父？","id":175},{"type":"multiline","name":"惆怅的商人","end":"true","text":"——我真想把您这副样子给拍下来！","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"为什么不拍呢？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"如果好看的话，我肯定愿意付钱的。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"啊？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"你会拍照吧？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"对啊。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"今天可是新沃尔西尼最重要的日子，每个人都会盛装出席。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"假面、华服，还有巨大而神秘的花车，如果我身处其中，肯定会想拍几张照片留念。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"但是游行的队伍滚滚向前，我根本没法为这件事停下来。这时候要是有个专业摄影师在一旁代劳，何乐而不为呢？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"再说到时候满大街都是卖啤酒卖冰淇淋的，你真不一定争得过人家——说实话，你们做的冰淇淋口味挺差的，不够甜。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"还愣着干什么！","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犟嘴的合伙人","text":"怎、怎么了？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"赶紧回去取相机，记得多买几卷胶片！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"谢谢您。一条尾巴里容不下两种皮毛，看来我和这家伙真的不适合在一起打拼。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"问题总会暴露的，问题也总有解决的办法。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"我记得城里没有建教堂......神父，您从哪儿来？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"蒙特卢佩。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"首都啊......好远。专门赶过来参加狂欢节吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"受一个老朋友的委托，过来看看。她对这个活动有些在意。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"叙拉古确实好久没有哪座城市举行过这么盛大的活动了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惆怅的商人","text":"同样是庆祝新生，隔壁莱塔尼亚的女皇庆典可是一年一次，而且听说都是万民齐聚，排场一次比一次大......","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_692_1#3$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"是啊，叙拉古好久没有哪座城市举行过这么盛大的活动了......","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿格尼尔","text":"不要下雨才好，不然维持秩序可就难喽。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_692_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_56_g7_tailorshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":220},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":221,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"......英格丽女士，你这是在？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"这块布料应该没用了吧？我从废布箱里随手拿的，用来擦一下刀。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"我可以给你找一块质地更软些的纯棉布。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"没那个必要。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"今天晚上就是狂欢节，几乎每条街上都安排了庆典活动，你就不用一直待在德蒙塔诺了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我答应了瓦古，要替你解决麻烦。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"是你查到了卢奇诺的下落，也是你陪我到威尼斯的宅邸接他回来。你帮的忙已经够多了，我应该对你表示感谢。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"没必要谢我，翁贝托。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"说服了老威尼斯不再追究卢奇诺的人是你，你自己救回了那孩子。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"说起来，那孩子还把自己关在房间里？一直没看见他，别又跑出去了。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"跑出去就跑出去了吧，这两天经历了太多事情，他的年纪还小，总得花些时间来整理。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"或许一直以来，我都把他管得太严了些。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"或许他只是一时间没法想清楚该怎么看待你，自己的爷爷，一个老裁缝，曾是让叙拉古的家族老大们都无法安眠的“剪裁师”。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"唉，并不重要。重要的是他从鬼门关走了这一遭，知道了这种种往事后，要怎么看自己。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"我又能陪他多久呢？他必须要想清楚。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"好了，英格丽女士，我们也就此告别吧。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"其实你已经知道了，对吧？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"什么？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"当年那个伤害了你女儿的凶手到底是谁。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"呵，为什么这么说？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"哈哈哈，英格丽女士，你忘了，我也曾经是个杀手。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"你的武器明明很锋利，不需要保养，你也没有类似的习惯。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"一个杀手，突然擦拭自己的刀，要么是打算封存它，要么是准备用它去杀人。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"倒也没错。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......虽然还只是猜测，但也算是有了一些收获，所以我说你不用感谢我。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"你来到新沃尔西尼，留在德蒙塔诺，是为了换取当年的真相——具体是谁策划了那场刺杀，在那场城邦内乱中伤害了丽萨小姐。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"这是你和瓦古的约定，但既然你已经知道了答案，它也就没了继续的意义。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"更何况我已经没有什么麻烦了。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"游戏还没有结束，所谓的“獠牙”还在城内，我和她们交过手，两个孩子，但身手都不弱。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我能找到她们，她们自然也能找到你。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"翁贝托，你老了病了，以你现在的身体状况......你会死。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"英格丽女士，那本来就是我快要走到的终点，你没法帮我避开它。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"起码今天晚上，我想安静地待一会儿。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":296},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":297,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_talentmarket","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"t","id":298},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"t","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"t","fadetime":"2","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_harbor_shipwhistle","volume":"0.8","id":304},{"type":"animtext","id":305,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月9日    4:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":306},{"type":"animtextclean","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"multiline","name":"港口工人","text":"我们就先走了——","id":311},{"type":"multiline","name":"港口工人","end":"true","text":"欸，新面孔，之前那个调度员呢？","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"......半小时前刚换班，他这会儿估计正在排练呢。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"啊？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"你们不知道？人家以前可是米兰剧场的驻场乐手，吹得一手好萨克斯，狂欢节刚筹备的时候他就被邀请进花车的随行乐队了。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"我懂了，他一直瞒着，就是想第二天拿着印着他照片的报纸向你们炫耀！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"这家伙！","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"所以今晚是你值班吗？","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"我刚来嘛。还好因为狂欢节，新沃尔西尼港今晚会进入特殊作业状态，没平时那么忙。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"我把收音机开到最大，隔空感受一下现场的氛围，也算参与了。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"你们快走吧，不然在队伍里抢不到好位置了。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"港口工人","text":"辛苦了，再见。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调度员","text":"呼~","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":337},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"1","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"你差点说漏嘴。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"要不你来？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"我可没在市长的就职宣传片里当过群演，没那个演技。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"能一样？我在那里面演的是自己，再说随时能再拍一条，刚刚要是露馅，安东尼奥今晚的所有布置就都暴露了。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"今晚对你我，对整个威尼斯家族都很重要。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"等我们真正掌控了这座城市，安东尼奥会兑现他的诺言，支持你......怎么说的来着，重振西西里的荣光。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":351},{"type":"multiline","name":"甘比诺","text":"我只希望自己不要和卡尔一个下场......","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":353},{"type":"multiline","name":"甘比诺","end":"true","text":"我们的顶级乐手呢？","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"在地狱里吹萨克斯呢——就是那边的集装箱，尸体等事情结束后再一并处理。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"那接下来调度台就交给你了。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"放心。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"今晚港口内一应车辆的进出都必须接受调度台的特别审验，威尼斯载具公司的车临时加进了名单。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"移动城市的定位系统已经关闭，只保留了一个加密频道。今晚除了家族的那艘陆行舰，所有载具都不能靠近这座城市。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"其他的人手就在外围。一旦陆行舰到达城市附近，你这边开始接驳，新沃尔西尼港所有不相干的人都会消失。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"安东尼奥那边呢？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"老板用得着我们操心吗？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"还有几个小时......享受今晚吧，新沃尔西尼人，享受真正的狂欢。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啧，这开幕词太俗气了。","id":373},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"——！","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"声音来自头顶。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"集装箱上方的吊机横梁上，白狼饶有兴味地看着惊愕的两人。她皱眉撇嘴，像一个实在忍受不了演出而出声打断的观众。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_701_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"你是谁？你一直在这里？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“调度员”","text":"甘比诺，做了她！","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_701_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"好。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.3","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":390},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"20","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":391},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":396},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_Qinggong","volume":"0.6","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_strangeclap","volume":"1","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"俗气你还鼓掌？","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":409},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act21side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act21side/m_sys_act21side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":410,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#3$1","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"你不是给了我第一个小反转吗？","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"不过甘比诺，我还挺期待你朝我动手的。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"我也想。但我不做成功概率低到可以忽略不计的事情。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#3$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"哈哈哈，你的小伙伴呢？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"卡彭？帮着小威尼斯处理其他事情。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#3$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"很忙嘛，西西里人。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"拉普兰德，你到底要做什么？","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"我们已经偷偷帮了你不少忙了，今天晚上，我没办法再——","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#1$1","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"嗯？","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#7$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"呃，我的意思是......","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"小威尼斯已经把整个家族在新沃尔西尼一年的积累全部投了进来，事到如今，哪怕你要搞什么破坏，我也帮不上忙。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#9$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"你还是自以为很了解我啊，甘比诺。而且都是老熟人了，我怎么会为难你呢？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"照常执行你老板交代的任务就好了。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"他想做的事情和我想做的事情并不冲突，说不定我其实是想帮他一把呢？","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"狂欢节嘛，每个人对这座新城市的愿望都该被实现。","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#1$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"所以你都不用打死地上这个家伙的——手太快了！","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"下次注意，别那么急着表现自己还是一个坏种，难怪你的市民积分攒得没卡彭多呢。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#4$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"......","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#4$1","id":443},{"type":"multiline","name":"甘比诺","text":"唉。","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#1$1","id":445},{"type":"multiline","name":"甘比诺","end":"true","text":"在那之前还有什么要我做的吗？","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#9$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"我有东西落在了威尼斯的宅邸，先去帮我取来。","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#6$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"啊，什么？","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#9$1","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"一个礼盒。","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_542_1#2$1","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"甘比诺","text":"......难道说，是那个小裁缝随身带着的——","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_npc_542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1564_1#3$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"嗯哼。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉普兰德","text":"另外，去多弄一些彩带气球和射灯什么的，快去！","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1564_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":459},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"charslot","id":462},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_tvnoise","layer":"1","id":463},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":464},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_56_i26.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":465},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":466},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","delay":"0.5","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"sticker","id":469,"text":"漫长的狂欢节","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"520","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"42"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":470},{"type":"sticker","id":471,"duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":474},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":475},{"type":"charslot","id":476},{"type":"background","id":477},{"type":"image","id":478}],"characters":["诺埃米","大帝","大祭司","大帝&大祭司","惆怅的商人","犟嘴的合伙人","？？？","阿格尼尔","翁贝托","英格丽","调度员","港口工人","甘比诺","“调度员”","拉普兰德"]}